#ASSERT `s 2026(b)(2)(B) the work experience program is conducted as the text requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:2458 | (C) A State seeking such a waiver shall provide assurances that the resulting employment and training program shall meet the requirements of subsections (a)(19) and (g) of section 402 1 of such Act (42 U.S.C. 602) (but not including the provision of transitional benefits under clauses (ii) through (vii) of section 402(g)(1)(A) 1) and sections 481 through 487 1 of such Act (42 U.S.C. 681 through 687). Each reference to “aid to families with dependent children” in such sections shall be deemed to be a reference to supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits for purposes of the demonstration project.
#ASSERT `s 2026(b)(2)(C) the State has provided the assurances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
