#ASSERT `s 2026(b)(2)(C) what the reference in the sections named is deemed to be` "temporary assistance for needy families" EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:2459 | (D) Notwithstanding the other provisions of this paragraph, participation in an employment and training activity in which supplemental nutrition assistance program benefits are converted to cash shall occur only with the consent of the participant.
-- (D): benefits converted to cash only with the participant's consent.
