§§ `(m) Evaluation of child support enforcement cooperation requirements`
-- src:2572 | The Secretary, in consultation with the Secretary of Health and Human Services, shall conduct an independent evaluation of a representative sample of States—
-- src:2573 | (A) to assess the implementation and impact of the eligibility requirements described in subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title in States that have formerly implemented or continue to implement those requirements, and the feasibility of implementing those requirements in other States;
-- src:2574 | (B) to assess the factors that contributed to the decision of States that formerly implemented the eligibility requirements described in each of subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title to cease such implementation;
-- src:2575 | (C) to review alternatives to the eligibility requirements described in each of subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title that are used by other States to assist participants in the supplemental nutrition assistance program to make or receive child support payments and the effectiveness of those alternatives; and
-- src:2576 | (D) to evaluate the costs and benefits to households and to State agencies, of requiring State agencies to implement each of the eligibility requirements described in subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title.
-- (m)(1): the evaluation's six fields, in order: consulted the Secretary of Health and Human Services; independent and a representative sample; (A); (B); (C); (D).
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(1) the evaluation is as the text requires` (`s 2026 evaluation of child support cooperation` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:2578 | The evaluation under paragraph (1) shall include, to the maximum extent practicable, an assessment of—
-- src:2579 | (A) the manner in which applicable State agencies implement and enforce the eligibility requirements described in subparagraph (A) of such paragraph, including—
-- src:2580 | (i) the procedures used by each State to determine cooperation, to sanction participants for failure to cooperate, and to determine good cause for noncooperation under each of subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title; and
-- src:2581 | (ii) the manner in which each State aligns the procedures for implementing those eligibility requirements with procedures for implementing other Federal programs that require cooperation with child support enforcement, including the program of block grants to States for temporary assistance for needy families established under part A of title IV of the Social Security Act (42 U.S.C. 601 et seq.), the Medicaid program under title XIX of the Social Security Act (42 U.S.C. 1396 et seq.), and programs carried out under the Child Care and Development Block Grant Act of 1990 (42 U.S.C. 9857 et seq.);
-- src:2582 | (B) the Federal, State, and local costs associated with implementing those eligibility requirements, including costs incurred under this chapter and by child support enforcement agencies for personnel, technology upgrades, and other costs;
-- src:2583 | (C) the effect of those eligibility requirements on the establishment of new child support orders, the establishment of paternity, changes in child support payments to custodial households, and changes in arrears owed on child support orders;
-- src:2584 | (D) with respect to the eligibility requirements under each of subsections (l) through (n) of section 2015 of this title—
-- src:2585 | (i) the number of individuals subject to those requirements;
-- src:2586 | (ii) the number of individuals in each State who meet those requirements; and
-- src:2587 | (iii) the number of individuals in each State who fail to meet those requirements;
-- src:2588 | (E) the number of individuals in each State for whom good cause for noncooperation has been found under section 2015(l)(2) of this title;
-- src:2589 | (F) the impact of those eligibility requirements on the supplemental nutrition assistance program eligibility, benefit levels, food security, income, and economic stability of—
-- src:2590 | (i) individuals subject to those requirements;
-- src:2591 | (ii) the household members of those individuals, including children; and
-- src:2592 | (iii) households with nontraditional family structures, including a household in which a grandparent is the primary caretaker of a grandchild of the grandparent.
-- (m)(2): the six assessments (A) to (F), "to the maximum extent practicable".
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(2) the evaluation includes the assessment the text requires` (`s 2026 assessment` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:2596 | Not later than 3 years after December 20, 2018, the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate a report describing the findings from the evaluation conducted under paragraph (1).
-- "Not later than 3 years after December 20, 2018" is 20 December 2021.
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(4) the date by which the report is due` EQUALS (Date 20 12 2021)
#ASSERT `s 2026(m)(4) the Secretary submitted the report in time` (JUST (Date 20 12 2021)) (Date 1 6 2022) EQUALS JUST TRUE
