-- src:2615 | Subject to subparagraph (B), each longitudinal database established under paragraph (1)—
-- src:2616 | (i) shall include monthly information about households and members of households that receive benefits under the supplemental nutrition assistance program in the participating State taken from existing information collected by the State agency including, if available,—
-- src:2617 | (I) demographic characteristics;
-- src:2618 | (II) income and financial resources (as described in section 2014(g) of this title);
-- src:2619 | (III) employment status;
-- src:2620 | (IV) household circumstances, such as deductible expenses; and
-- src:2621 | (V) the amount of the monthly allotment received under the supplemental nutrition assistance program; and
-- src:2622 | (ii) may include information from other State data sources such as—
-- src:2623 | (I) earnings and employment data from the State department of labor;
-- src:2624 | (II) health insurance program data; or
-- src:2625 | (III) data from participation in other programs administered by the State.
-- (n)(4)(A): the five kinds "shall" be included "if available"; the three "may" be included; the lists are not closed.
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 demographic characteristics` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 demographic characteristics` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 income and financial resources` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 income and financial resources` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 employment status` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 employment status` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 household circumstances, such as deductible expenses` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 household circumstances, such as deductible expenses` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 the amount of the monthly allotment received` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 the amount of the monthly allotment received` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 earnings and employment data from the State department of labor` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 health insurance program data` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 data from participation in other programs administered by the State` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2026(n)(4)(A) the database includes the data` `s 2026 some other data` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
